{"id":"471177","name":"圆蛤丝瓜汤","author":"花鱼儿","authorId":"404188","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/471177/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"圆蛤","amount":"225克"},{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"200克"}],"sub":[{"name":"料酒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材：圆蛤（已清洗）、丝瓜。","img":"images/471177/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将丝瓜去皮清洗一下。","img":"images/471177/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放在案板上切成滚刀块。","img":"images/471177/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"接着，将圆蛤和切好的丝瓜下入清水锅中。","img":"images/471177/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加适量的料酒。","img":"images/471177/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"煮开、煮至圆蛤开口。","img":"images/471177/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"然后，加适量的盐。","img":"images/471177/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调味翻匀即成。","img":"images/471177/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}